WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 26]

01:43.100 --> 01:44.340
Let's see how Luo Ge is doing.

01:44.780 --> 01:45.420
This tribulation

01:45.820 --> 01:46.820
is not his only.

01:47.340 --> 01:48.500
He must survive it.

01:49.729 --> 01:50.340
Good.

01:51.340 --> 01:53.930
If he can't survive the tribulation,

01:54.100 --> 01:56.220
you must get the sixth talisman pearl.

01:57.289 --> 01:59.020
But with the sixth talisman pearl taken,

01:59.060 --> 02:00.460
I'm afraid that Liu Shao...

02:01.460 --> 02:02.900
I'll go bring the Ancient Herb and the Glazed Fruit

02:03.020 --> 02:03.940
to her.

02:09.419 --> 02:10.500
Master Zhuo.

02:11.300 --> 02:12.020
We're counting on you.

02:39.980 --> 02:41.540
Do you want to use the formation to suppress me?

02:41.540 --> 02:42.820
It's not that easy.

02:42.820 --> 02:44.740
These are the talisman pearls from three days ago.

02:44.740 --> 02:46.700
And you thought it would work on me?

03:01.370 --> 03:02.980
Liu Shao, come out for lunch.

03:04.060 --> 03:04.730
Liu Shao.

03:07.780 --> 03:08.380
Liu Shao.

03:10.210 --> 03:11.300
Where did she go?

03:13.020 --> 03:14.100
Liu Shao is not here.

03:14.810 --> 03:15.940
Wang Jian didn't come either.

03:16.860 --> 03:18.300
Did something happen?

03:25.300 --> 03:27.060
As long as Luo Ge is not here,

03:27.780 --> 03:29.100
you can't

03:29.329 --> 03:33.220
fight with me.

03:37.700 --> 03:38.660
Looks like there's no time.

03:39.100 --> 03:39.610
Liu Shao.

03:39.940 --> 03:40.620
Sorry for my offense.

03:57.180 --> 03:57.820
Qiuxian.

03:57.820 --> 03:58.660
Hold on.

03:58.660 --> 04:00.010
The talisman pearl will be here soon.

04:00.850 --> 04:01.500
Change the formation.

05:20.300 --> 05:22.780
Then I'll start with you.

05:24.490 --> 05:25.020
Immortal Master!

05:25.580 --> 05:26.140
Immortal Master!

05:26.940 --> 05:27.940
Don't come over.

05:28.020 --> 05:29.900
Or we'll all die together.

05:36.700 --> 05:37.420
Rong.

05:52.140 --> 05:52.740
Rong.

06:11.980 --> 06:12.610
Sister.

06:12.810 --> 06:13.650
Let go!

06:14.260 --> 06:15.420
Let's die together!

06:26.580 --> 06:27.090
Master!

06:27.740 --> 06:28.370
Rong.

07:12.490 --> 07:12.980
Immortal Master.

07:13.180 --> 07:13.700
Immortal Master.

07:15.380 --> 07:15.900
Immortal Master.

07:17.500 --> 07:17.900
Here.

07:18.540 --> 07:19.140
Immortal Master.

07:19.580 --> 07:20.580
Are you all right?

07:23.210 --> 07:24.580
Take him down to heal his wounds.

07:28.780 --> 07:29.220
Immortal Master.

07:33.180 --> 07:34.100
That's strange.

07:34.500 --> 07:36.140
Why was there a change in heaven and earth just now?

07:49.740 --> 07:50.780
You are...

07:57.020 --> 07:57.300
Me?

07:57.380 --> 07:58.659
Have I seen you somewhere before?

07:59.180 --> 08:00.580
Was it in the mortal world or the Immortal Palace?

08:00.980 --> 08:03.820
I knew the great liar Lu Li in the mortal world.

08:04.580 --> 08:05.860
I know Luo Ge, who is worse than the big liar Lu Li

08:05.900 --> 08:08.540
in the Immortal Palace.

08:11.100 --> 08:12.540
That's all me.

08:12.740 --> 08:14.540
How dare you say that?

08:15.220 --> 08:16.820
Liu Shao suffers the most.

08:17.660 --> 08:18.740
She's so simple.

08:18.740 --> 08:20.020
But you keep messing with her.

08:20.900 --> 08:21.740
Have you seen Liu Shao?

08:22.180 --> 08:22.890
Where is she?

08:23.340 --> 08:24.140
Right there.

08:24.460 --> 08:26.180
Psycho is bullying her.

08:29.460 --> 08:30.540
Wait for me.

08:32.940 --> 08:33.500
Did you find out?

08:34.179 --> 08:35.100
Yes.

08:35.539 --> 08:36.530
These days,

08:36.860 --> 08:39.140
the demon who is desperately collecting spirit energy,

08:39.220 --> 08:39.940
and

08:40.220 --> 08:40.980
the fortune-teller

08:41.059 --> 08:43.690
who clashed with His Majesty and Fu

08:44.090 --> 08:45.570
were all ordered by Ao Yin.

08:45.980 --> 08:46.780
Ao Yin?

08:47.300 --> 08:48.460
The son of Ao Hen?

08:49.370 --> 08:50.380
As far as I know,

08:50.540 --> 08:52.780
Xie Lingqi brought Ao Yin's demon energy back

08:52.780 --> 08:53.940
to the Immortal Palace.

08:53.940 --> 08:55.450
But I don't know

08:55.650 --> 08:57.330
how he escaped.

08:58.700 --> 08:59.940
Could it really be him?

09:08.020 --> 09:08.340
Here.

09:25.220 --> 09:26.820
Don't listen to that grass demon.

09:27.700 --> 09:29.500
I just fought with that demon

09:29.780 --> 09:31.220
for too long

09:31.580 --> 09:33.100
and got a bit exhausted.

09:39.620 --> 09:40.210
Trust me.

09:40.940 --> 09:42.300
No matter if I'm immortal,

09:43.340 --> 09:44.820
I have to protect the people around me.

09:49.580 --> 09:50.820
This is more like it.

09:51.770 --> 09:52.580
More like what?

09:53.020 --> 09:54.700
Immortal Luo Ge.

09:56.340 --> 09:57.860
Do you want me to be Luo Ge so much?

10:03.220 --> 10:04.810
Whether you are an immortal,

10:05.300 --> 10:06.180
a mortal

10:06.780 --> 10:08.020
or a liar,

10:08.300 --> 10:10.060
as long as I can be with you

10:10.860 --> 10:12.220
and listen to your heartbeat,

10:13.020 --> 10:14.340
my heart is filled with joy.

10:16.740 --> 10:17.620
I'm glad you like it.

10:18.940 --> 10:20.100
If there is danger again,

10:20.570 --> 10:21.900
hide behind me.

10:22.650 --> 10:24.180
I can learn magic again.

10:24.500 --> 10:25.060
Okay?

10:25.900 --> 10:26.650
Good.

10:27.820 --> 10:30.060
I wish I could hide behind you too.

10:38.620 --> 10:40.140
Something's wrong!

10:42.740 --> 10:43.420
Liu Shao.

10:43.580 --> 10:44.380
Immortal Luo Ge.

10:44.580 --> 10:45.860
Wang Jian has been captured by the great demon.

11:01.060 --> 11:01.580
Luo Ning.

11:02.500 --> 11:03.620
I've found many tonic products.

11:03.780 --> 11:05.060
You can pick something you like with me tomorrow.

11:05.460 --> 11:06.420
You will be cured.

11:07.540 --> 11:08.260
Tonic?

11:21.580 --> 11:23.300
If Luo Ge doesn't come back in two days,

11:23.610 --> 11:25.780
I'll have to take the last talisman pearl from Liu Shao.

11:32.140 --> 11:32.820
Sister.

11:33.620 --> 11:34.420
What is it?

11:34.820 --> 11:35.420
Liu Shao

11:36.260 --> 11:37.580
asked for the Phoenix Tears from me.

11:38.580 --> 11:39.420
The Phoenix Tears?

11:41.220 --> 11:42.020
Three days later,

11:42.780 --> 11:44.260
Luo Ge will be back to who he was.

11:45.500 --> 11:46.180
But

11:46.900 --> 11:48.300
can I ask you for something?

11:49.220 --> 11:49.860
Go ahead.

11:52.020 --> 11:52.860
The Phoenix Tears?

11:53.980 --> 11:55.220
Do you want to forget Luo Ge?

11:58.580 --> 12:00.060
I want him to forget me.

12:01.300 --> 12:02.890
Forget that he ever loved me.

12:04.260 --> 12:05.500
Forget that I appeared

12:06.860 --> 12:07.660
and left.

12:07.860 --> 12:09.300
Liu Shao is very sober.

12:09.740 --> 12:11.260
She has already figured out her fate.

12:12.940 --> 12:14.450
But can Phoenix Tears

12:14.900 --> 12:16.330
break the Soul-devouring Curse?

12:17.980 --> 12:18.650
Maybe

12:18.650 --> 12:20.130
he can forget about Liu Shao for a while.

12:20.900 --> 12:23.100
Maybe the Soul-devouring Spell will never strike again.

12:23.340 --> 12:24.260
This is Glazed Fruit.

12:24.260 --> 12:25.620
It can help you recover.

12:25.940 --> 12:26.780
And this.

12:28.710 --> 12:32.110
[Phoenix Tears]

12:35.450 --> 12:36.940
Even if the Phoenix Tears works,

12:37.740 --> 12:39.220
Luo Ge can't be able to

12:39.220 --> 12:40.260
pass through the tribulation in a couple of days.

12:41.380 --> 12:42.940
But it should make Luo Ge

12:43.740 --> 12:45.060
get out of the present state faster.

12:45.940 --> 12:47.540
If he comes back

12:48.140 --> 12:49.820
and knows about what you've done…

12:53.020 --> 12:53.740
He'll probably

12:54.300 --> 12:55.580
kill me.

13:09.380 --> 13:09.860
This…

13:15.260 --> 13:15.860
Fu.

13:16.940 --> 13:18.620
This is the tonic you found for me?

13:20.010 --> 13:20.620
That's right.

13:21.180 --> 13:21.740
Luo Ning,

13:22.330 --> 13:23.500
you were born in the Immortal Palace.

13:23.780 --> 13:24.780
Your vitality is pure.

13:25.220 --> 13:26.530
If it were ordinary demon energy,

13:26.700 --> 13:27.660
you couldn't use it.

13:28.300 --> 13:30.020
So I've found some human masters.

13:30.980 --> 13:32.420
See which one has pure spiritual energy,

13:32.700 --> 13:34.180
we will take his vitality

13:34.730 --> 13:35.380
to heal you.

13:36.260 --> 13:36.940
So

13:37.700 --> 13:39.420
you've been running around these days

13:39.770 --> 13:40.980
for this?

13:42.140 --> 13:42.660
Of course.

13:44.540 --> 13:45.180
Luo Ning.

13:45.650 --> 13:46.260
I told you.

13:46.340 --> 13:47.220
I will cure you.

13:47.330 --> 13:48.540
But I also told you

13:48.980 --> 13:50.620
not killing innocent people is my bottom line.

13:50.780 --> 13:51.380
I know that.

13:52.140 --> 13:53.700
That's why I didn't take their vitality.

13:54.690 --> 13:55.780
See which one

13:55.980 --> 13:56.940
you think can heal you,

13:57.210 --> 13:58.380
we'll take his vitality then.

13:58.380 --> 13:58.940
Is that okay?

13:59.500 --> 14:00.100
I don't want to.

14:00.980 --> 14:02.050
Release them.

14:02.260 --> 14:02.780
I can't.

14:04.860 --> 14:06.340
I said to release them.

14:06.820 --> 14:07.660
Or else

14:08.330 --> 14:09.420
I'll never talk to you again.

14:11.180 --> 14:12.100
Fine.

14:12.220 --> 14:12.620
Luo Ning.

14:13.780 --> 14:14.500
I'll do as you say.

14:14.980 --> 14:15.980
I'll release them now.

14:16.100 --> 14:16.660
Okay?

14:19.780 --> 14:20.580
They're here.

14:28.300 --> 14:28.860
Brother.

14:30.860 --> 14:31.420
Brother.

14:36.340 --> 14:37.130
This is Luo Ning,

14:37.220 --> 14:37.860
your sister.

14:40.690 --> 14:42.620
This is Liu Shao,

14:42.980 --> 14:44.420
your future sister-in-law.

14:45.420 --> 14:46.020
Liu Shao.

14:46.810 --> 14:48.020
What's wrong with brother?

14:48.490 --> 14:49.460
He hasn't recovered yet.

14:49.820 --> 14:50.820
But he should be soon.

14:51.210 --> 14:52.020
You, on the other hand,

14:52.380 --> 14:53.940
why do you look so bad?

14:55.380 --> 14:57.220
And what's with these people?

15:07.780 --> 15:08.450
Brother.

15:11.620 --> 15:12.650
B… Brother.

15:13.060 --> 15:14.580
He wants to take our vitality.

15:15.140 --> 15:16.140
He... he's got us

15:16.180 --> 15:17.740
to treat the girl.

15:18.220 --> 15:20.540
I didn't realize she was

15:20.700 --> 15:21.620
your sister.

15:27.460 --> 15:28.140
Immortal.

15:29.020 --> 15:30.420
Luo Ning was accidentally attacked.

15:30.860 --> 15:32.020
Her immortal energy is severely damaged.

15:33.060 --> 15:34.020
I just want to find some people

15:34.020 --> 15:35.260
to repair her vitality.

15:36.060 --> 15:37.540
I didn't mean to kill anyone.

15:42.020 --> 15:43.380
If you did kill someone,

15:43.380 --> 15:44.420
I wouldn't forgive you.

15:45.260 --> 15:46.380
Neither would my sister.

15:49.980 --> 15:51.500
You know your sister.

15:52.140 --> 15:52.820
I didn't

15:53.060 --> 15:54.220
think it through.

15:54.860 --> 15:56.260
I'll let them go

15:56.700 --> 15:57.700
as Luo Ning wants.

16:03.820 --> 16:04.300
Brother.

16:06.140 --> 16:06.650
Brother.

16:09.810 --> 16:11.690
Immortal, I'm sure you have a better way

16:11.690 --> 16:12.900
to cure Luo Ning, right?

16:14.210 --> 16:14.780
Brother.

16:14.850 --> 16:16.020
I'm fine.

16:17.500 --> 16:19.660
It takes a lot of spiritual energy to heal the vitality damage.

16:25.570 --> 16:26.300
This...

16:26.820 --> 16:27.900
should be able to heal you.

16:38.220 --> 16:39.620
It's the most precious treasure of my clan,

16:39.820 --> 16:40.580
the Glazed Fruit.

16:41.900 --> 16:43.380
I heard the only one

16:43.540 --> 16:44.690
has been sent to the Immortal Palace.

16:44.890 --> 16:45.820
I didn't expect

16:46.500 --> 16:47.980
you had it.

16:51.780 --> 16:52.500
With this,

16:52.940 --> 16:53.940
you'll be cured for sure.

16:57.780 --> 16:58.460
Liu Shao.

16:59.380 --> 17:01.020
Since you've given me this treasure,

17:01.420 --> 17:03.700
I'll let Fu continue to help with my healing.

17:05.140 --> 17:06.619
You must take care of my brother for me.

17:07.540 --> 17:08.210
Don't worry.

17:19.819 --> 17:21.450
The demon called Fu

17:21.780 --> 17:22.859
doesn't look like a good guy.

17:24.099 --> 17:25.980
Then why didn't you bring Luo Ning back?

17:26.859 --> 17:27.859
If I bring her back,

17:27.859 --> 17:29.540
I don't know how to heal her with the Glazed Fruit.

17:29.820 --> 17:30.260
By the way,

17:31.220 --> 17:32.260
where did you get the Glazed Fruit?

17:35.220 --> 17:36.900
From the people at the Immortal Palace.

17:36.900 --> 17:38.220
They said to give it to you.

17:38.220 --> 17:39.580
I don't know if it works.

17:40.340 --> 17:42.100
You've saved it

17:43.020 --> 17:44.940
for your beloved one to help him survive the tribulation.

17:45.100 --> 17:47.140
You made me pick a leaf for you.

17:49.100 --> 17:52.570
Sooner or later, I'll become bald grass.

17:55.620 --> 17:55.930
Good.

17:56.420 --> 17:57.220
Now good.

17:57.660 --> 17:58.420
I've had hair loss.

17:59.260 --> 18:00.330
I'd better grow some Polygonum Multiforum.

18:03.140 --> 18:03.780
What's wrong?

18:03.980 --> 18:05.220
You're like wild horses.

18:05.420 --> 18:06.140
What's going on?

18:06.380 --> 18:07.460
There's a flood in the east.

18:07.780 --> 18:08.260
Maybe

18:08.420 --> 18:09.420
it's going to flood this area.

18:09.820 --> 18:11.050
We're going to the city and taking shelter.

18:11.220 --> 18:11.820
Yes, that's right.

18:12.060 --> 18:13.220
It's not a peaceful world these days.

18:13.260 --> 18:14.340
You guys should pack up too.

18:15.220 --> 18:15.660
Let's go.

18:18.340 --> 18:18.700
Does it

18:19.940 --> 18:20.780
have anything to do with me?

18:24.020 --> 18:25.260
If I say yes,

18:25.820 --> 18:26.700
what would you do?

18:29.420 --> 18:30.900
What would I do?

18:31.260 --> 18:32.580
What can I do?

18:33.700 --> 18:35.940
I can't even protect my sister and the people around me.

18:37.090 --> 18:38.380
What can I do?

18:59.340 --> 19:00.380
How do you feel?

19:00.980 --> 19:02.300
The Glaze Fruit works.

19:02.460 --> 19:03.620
I feel better.

19:04.380 --> 19:05.050
That's good.

19:12.060 --> 19:13.660
Since you found your brother this time,

19:14.340 --> 19:15.460
why didn't you

19:15.700 --> 19:16.460
stay with him?

19:17.820 --> 19:19.580
He already has Liu Shao.

19:19.740 --> 19:20.900
I wanted to stay with you.

19:22.060 --> 19:22.380
Good.

19:23.220 --> 19:23.860
Then

19:24.100 --> 19:24.940
I'll show you around.

19:25.260 --> 19:26.740
I've seen the place where you grew up.

19:27.180 --> 19:29.100
I also want to show you the place where I grew up.

19:30.020 --> 19:30.460
Okay.

19:31.980 --> 19:32.420
Come here.

19:52.820 --> 19:54.460
I didn't think you'd come here.

19:56.060 --> 19:57.860
I just want to see Luo Ge for something trivial.

19:58.860 --> 20:00.300
I wonder how he's doing.

20:03.380 --> 20:04.140
You came here yourself.

20:04.140 --> 20:05.370
It's not something trivial, is it?

20:10.540 --> 20:12.460
Can I know what's going on?

20:17.700 --> 20:18.580
A few days ago, Ao Yin

20:18.780 --> 20:19.780
escaped from the Immortal Palace.

20:21.460 --> 20:22.380
Ao Yin?

20:22.860 --> 20:23.540
Is he

20:23.540 --> 20:24.460
the son of Ao Hen?

20:25.500 --> 20:26.570
Now the Four Seasons Monument is unstable.

20:27.340 --> 20:28.900
Ao Yin is killing people all over the mortal world.

20:29.780 --> 20:31.340
This must be related to

20:31.940 --> 20:32.860
the evil thing under the Four Seasons Monument.

20:34.540 --> 20:35.460
Do you think

20:35.780 --> 20:37.020
he's collecting spirit energy?

20:37.420 --> 20:37.860
Yes.

20:38.420 --> 20:39.220
He's collecting spirit energy

20:39.580 --> 20:40.420
for elixir

20:40.860 --> 20:42.300
to help the evil creature replenish its energy,

20:43.060 --> 20:44.820
so that it can break the suppression of the Four Seasons Monument.

20:45.500 --> 20:46.980
You can't deal with him?

20:47.540 --> 20:48.740
If I were to do it alone,

20:49.660 --> 20:50.700
it'd be hard to say who'd win.

20:51.170 --> 20:51.940
So I'd like

20:52.380 --> 20:53.620
to use Luo Ge's help.

20:54.660 --> 20:55.540
Don't call Luo Ge.

20:59.940 --> 21:01.980
Luo Ge is just a mortal now.

21:02.820 --> 21:03.900
He cannot defend himself.

21:04.900 --> 21:06.780
If we rashly interrupt his path of cultivation,

21:07.180 --> 21:07.740
I'm afraid

21:08.620 --> 21:10.180
he'll be possessed.

21:11.330 --> 21:12.220
By then,

21:13.100 --> 21:14.580
I'm afraid that all beings in the Three Realms

21:15.660 --> 21:17.180
will be buried with him.

21:20.540 --> 21:21.460
Where did she go

21:22.260 --> 21:23.100
in such a short time?

21:30.660 --> 21:31.340
Or

21:31.780 --> 21:33.300
can I go help you?

21:34.380 --> 21:35.380
My power of the sun

21:35.500 --> 21:36.500
can restrain evil energy.

21:36.780 --> 21:37.460
Yes, it does.

21:38.620 --> 21:39.980
But it's a dangerous trip.

21:41.060 --> 21:42.500
I know it's too risky.

21:43.460 --> 21:44.220
It's just

21:45.220 --> 21:46.700
I don't want to die in front of him.

21:48.060 --> 21:48.700
What did you say?

21:57.370 --> 21:59.300
I've already lost six talisman pearls.

22:00.620 --> 22:02.020
To fight for three more days,

22:03.300 --> 22:03.860
tomorrow,

22:05.100 --> 22:06.410
I will give up the seventh.

22:09.100 --> 22:09.940
The seventh one?

22:11.100 --> 22:12.020
The last one?

22:18.500 --> 22:19.140
No way!

22:20.140 --> 22:20.900
Absolutely not!

22:23.620 --> 22:24.980
Even if we don't deal with Ao Yin,

22:27.620 --> 22:28.420
tomorrow

22:30.570 --> 22:32.140
I'll lose the seventh one too.

22:35.380 --> 22:36.340
In the end,

22:39.340 --> 22:40.980
I want to do something for him.

22:47.740 --> 22:49.050
Can you keep it a secret for me?

22:56.020 --> 22:56.940
Please

22:57.700 --> 22:58.580
do me a favor.

24:02.140 --> 24:02.860
Did you go out for a walk?

24:03.940 --> 24:04.860
Why didn't you ask me to join you?

24:09.260 --> 24:10.220
Have some peanuts.

24:10.220 --> 24:11.020
I've peeled them for you.

24:18.420 --> 24:19.060
Is it good?

24:20.380 --> 24:21.020
Yes.

24:22.900 --> 24:23.780
Have some more.

24:26.260 --> 24:27.340
I'm a little tired.

24:27.700 --> 24:28.940
I want to take a break.

24:29.930 --> 24:30.420
Okay.

24:31.420 --> 24:32.450
Let me put it away.

24:33.290 --> 24:34.580
You can eat it after the rest.

25:45.740 --> 25:46.460
Luo Ge.

25:47.700 --> 25:49.060
We're running out of time.

25:50.220 --> 25:51.340
You should go back to Immortal Palace.

25:52.500 --> 25:53.260
It's time for me to go too.

26:06.050 --> 26:11.550
[Phoenix Tears]

26:15.580 --> 26:15.900
Okay.

26:17.620 --> 26:19.940
I've got a fence to tie after dinner.

26:24.500 --> 26:26.700
You didn't make all these dishes, did you?

26:27.300 --> 26:29.180
I had someone buy them from town.

26:29.660 --> 26:30.740
I'm afraid it's getting a little cold.

26:33.900 --> 26:34.380
Liu Shao.

26:35.620 --> 26:37.260
You can tell me what you like.

26:37.900 --> 26:38.740
I can learn to cook.

26:44.410 --> 26:46.460
I've also asked someone to bring a pot of good liquor.

26:48.460 --> 26:49.820
You should try it.

27:08.420 --> 27:09.410
What's wrong?

27:09.900 --> 27:10.980
You don't like it?

27:31.140 --> 27:31.900
Liu Shao.

27:33.820 --> 27:35.020
Do you remember what we said?

27:36.140 --> 27:37.740
I'll let you hide behind me.

27:38.540 --> 27:39.140
Actually,

27:40.180 --> 27:42.140
I have seriously thought about

27:42.940 --> 27:44.260
whether to be immortal again.

27:44.120 --> 27:50.880
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

27:45.940 --> 27:47.620
In my opinion, identity is not important.

27:48.020 --> 27:49.980
It doesn't matter whether I live in the Immortal Palace or the mortal world.

27:51.020 --> 27:52.060
What really matters is

27:52.850 --> 27:57.010
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

27:52.860 --> 27:53.700
that you are here

27:55.580 --> 27:56.580
by my side.

27:58.610 --> 28:04.860
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

28:05.530 --> 28:10.740
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

28:06.620 --> 28:08.540
I don't care if I'm Luo Ge or Lu Li.

28:10.900 --> 28:12.450
I'm only happy when you're here.

28:11.960 --> 28:15.570
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

28:13.540 --> 28:14.980
That's the time to cherish.

28:16.120 --> 28:19.600
♫I can't forget you♫

28:19.600 --> 28:23.220
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

28:23.430 --> 28:26.110
♫I have no other choice♫

28:24.300 --> 28:25.420
Luo Ge.

28:26.110 --> 28:29.850
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

28:29.850 --> 28:32.250
♫For billions of years♫

28:33.040 --> 28:36.780
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

28:36.780 --> 28:39.260
♫A few hasty nights♫

28:40.100 --> 28:43.920
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

28:43.920 --> 28:47.160
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

28:47.320 --> 28:53.920
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

29:04.740 --> 29:05.820
Give me a reason.

29:08.830 --> 29:16.000
♫The remaining flowers in the mirror reflect the moon in the water♫

29:15.180 --> 29:16.020
It's better for you

29:17.270 --> 29:21.920
♫We can't live up to such a good time♫

29:20.500 --> 29:21.780
to forget me.

29:22.970 --> 29:29.450
♫Recalling the unforgettable glance at the beginning♫

29:29.980 --> 29:33.520
♫I realized that it was a thousand years ago♫

29:33.520 --> 29:36.580
♫Is this bad luck, or good luck?♫

29:35.700 --> 29:36.820
I won't forget.

29:36.580 --> 29:40.200
♫He said that responsibility and love are difficult to balance♫

29:38.500 --> 29:39.780
You can't choose for me.

29:40.200 --> 29:43.030
♫He had no choice but to leave me♫

29:40.980 --> 29:41.770
Forgetting you

29:43.180 --> 29:44.740
is the hardest thing for me.

29:43.720 --> 29:47.280
♫The past has passed, so do not linger♫

29:47.280 --> 29:49.990
♫My love for you is still so strong♫

29:50.620 --> 29:54.300
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

29:54.300 --> 29:57.860
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

29:57.860 --> 30:05.800
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

30:06.220 --> 30:09.670
♫Life is like a grain of sand♫

30:09.670 --> 30:13.110
♫It burns the fire in my heart♫

30:13.290 --> 30:21.120
♫I want to burn myself to hear you say. You have never changed♫

30:36.430 --> 30:40.130
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

30:40.130 --> 30:43.260
♫For billions of years♫

30:43.460 --> 30:47.250
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

30:47.250 --> 30:50.260
♫A few hasty nights♫

30:47.330 --> 30:47.940
Luo Ge,

30:49.210 --> 30:49.900
I'm sorry.

30:50.570 --> 30:54.290
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

30:51.940 --> 30:53.140
You have your mission.

30:54.290 --> 30:57.760
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

30:57.760 --> 31:08.210
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

30:58.620 --> 30:59.540
The great calamity is upon us.

31:00.860 --> 31:02.780
It's already luxurious for us

31:04.020 --> 31:05.300
to have six days of joy.

31:14.100 --> 31:14.700
Luo Ge.

31:16.300 --> 31:16.980
Forget about me.

31:18.940 --> 31:21.660
Then you won't have to suffer the pain of the Soul-devouring Spell anymore.

32:00.540 --> 32:01.220
Let's go.

32:23.060 --> 32:25.260
This is the Mysterious Light Forest of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

32:26.580 --> 32:27.140
That's right.

32:27.780 --> 32:28.810
After you picked the Mysterious Light,

32:29.300 --> 32:30.660
the mists cleared.

32:30.980 --> 32:33.100
This forest is gradually abandoned.

32:41.580 --> 32:43.540
Why do you have to see my hand?

32:43.740 --> 32:45.260
The other one.

32:47.780 --> 32:48.570
Be careful!

32:52.740 --> 32:54.140
Ao Yin took it over

32:54.420 --> 32:55.730
for the abundance of spiritual energy here.

32:56.900 --> 32:58.860
Ao Hen had given Ao Yin much demon energy.

32:59.460 --> 33:01.580
And he had the evil thing under the Four Seasons Monument to help him.

33:02.100 --> 33:05.100
So he is now more powerful than his mother.

33:14.780 --> 33:15.540
Liu Shao.

33:16.340 --> 33:16.740
You…

33:17.220 --> 33:18.540
Why do you want me to forget you?

33:18.780 --> 33:19.500
It's better for you

33:20.820 --> 33:22.220
to forget about me.

33:29.540 --> 33:31.740
Why did you say this?

33:32.660 --> 33:34.170
What's going on?

33:40.500 --> 33:41.020
Liu Shao.

33:41.140 --> 33:41.740
Wait.

33:44.180 --> 33:44.860
There's danger here.

33:52.140 --> 33:53.260
What's going on?

33:55.060 --> 33:55.540
Luo Ge.

34:00.700 --> 34:00.980
This is...

34:01.290 --> 34:02.130
This is the Phoenix Tears.

34:04.860 --> 34:05.820
What's going on?

34:06.100 --> 34:07.940
Why did you take the Phoenix Tears?

34:11.860 --> 34:12.780
Soul-devouring Curse?

34:13.460 --> 34:14.340
I thought the Phoenix Tears

34:14.460 --> 34:15.179
could make people forget love.

34:15.659 --> 34:17.050
Why did it trigger the Soul-devouring Spell?

34:17.449 --> 34:18.340
Forget love…

34:18.580 --> 34:19.699
What is the Phoenix Tears?

34:19.980 --> 34:21.780
It can make you forget

34:21.780 --> 34:23.060
what and who you love.

34:23.460 --> 34:24.739
I can't forget her.

34:26.500 --> 34:27.100
Master.

34:27.340 --> 34:28.139
Where's the antidote?

34:28.300 --> 34:29.100
Give me the antidote!

34:29.420 --> 34:31.659
There is no antidote for the Phoenix Tears and the Soul-devouring Curse.

34:38.980 --> 34:40.980
How come the Soul-devouring Curse reacts so strongly?

34:42.420 --> 34:44.340
No, I won't forget.

34:44.780 --> 34:45.860
The Soul-devouring Curse can't make me.

34:47.100 --> 34:48.699
Neither does the Phoenix Tears.

34:50.449 --> 34:51.739
There's something weird about the Soul-devouring Curse.

34:58.380 --> 34:58.940
Be careful!

35:09.660 --> 35:10.100
He Na!

35:32.380 --> 35:33.380
The Soul-devouring Spell

35:33.660 --> 35:34.780
is coming out by itself.

35:35.410 --> 35:36.940
I thought the most forbidden spell in the Three Realms

35:37.780 --> 35:39.300
is insoluble.

35:40.140 --> 35:41.700
Why did it leave the host by itself?

35:44.980 --> 35:45.540
It's

35:46.420 --> 35:47.940
hiding from something.

35:57.060 --> 35:57.980
No way.

35:58.220 --> 35:59.740
The Phoenix Tears is starting to work.

36:03.100 --> 36:03.700
No!

36:04.260 --> 36:05.060
No.

36:05.540 --> 36:06.900
I can't forget her.

36:17.180 --> 36:18.020
I can't forget.

36:21.060 --> 36:21.820
Wait a minute.

36:22.380 --> 36:24.700
There must be a reason

36:25.380 --> 36:26.690
the spell flew out of my body.

36:27.540 --> 36:29.010
If my guess is right,

36:29.900 --> 36:30.580
Master,

36:30.860 --> 36:32.180
no matter what I do next,

36:32.420 --> 36:33.700
don't stop me.

36:36.220 --> 36:38.020
Ao Yin has a natural advantage here.

36:38.180 --> 36:40.300
Your power is limited away from the water.

36:40.660 --> 36:41.780
You're no match for him.

36:42.420 --> 36:43.500
Take my talisman pearl

36:43.740 --> 36:44.660
and my divine spirit and go first.

36:45.170 --> 36:45.700
I can't.

36:46.180 --> 36:47.420
Let's go together.

36:55.340 --> 36:56.540
Come back.

36:59.020 --> 36:59.940
What are you doing?

37:00.140 --> 37:01.020
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

37:02.180 --> 37:03.540
I see.

37:07.740 --> 37:08.730
We've been through

37:09.570 --> 37:11.900
so much together.

37:17.620 --> 37:18.700
I can't believe

37:18.940 --> 37:19.700
the Soul-devouring Spell

37:20.220 --> 37:21.180
is fearful of Phoenix Tears.

37:23.300 --> 37:24.660
Soul-devouring Spell.

37:25.580 --> 37:27.940
You made me suffer so much.

37:28.780 --> 37:30.500
I never thought

37:31.260 --> 37:33.220
you'd be so useful one day.

37:42.500 --> 37:44.380
Don't leave!

37:47.060 --> 37:48.540
Luo Ge, are you crazy?

37:49.300 --> 37:50.060
If you go on like this,

37:50.220 --> 37:51.980
the Soul-devouring Spell will kill you.

37:58.380 --> 37:59.860
I won't forget her

38:00.500 --> 38:01.980
even if I die.

38:14.580 --> 38:15.540
Luo Ge.

38:20.100 --> 38:21.460
Now that you're on my turf,

38:22.100 --> 38:24.020
you won't leave alive.

38:39.540 --> 38:40.380
Demon King in White,

38:41.580 --> 38:43.260
it was you

38:43.500 --> 38:44.340
who fought against my mother.

38:46.420 --> 38:48.660
And you are the one the master is looking for.

38:52.580 --> 38:54.060
Two good spirits.

38:54.940 --> 38:56.020
Add them to the elixir.

38:56.860 --> 38:59.140
The master will be very happy.

39:35.700 --> 39:36.180
Liu Shao.

39:38.260 --> 39:38.740
Liu Shao.

39:55.130 --> 39:57.450
I was wondering who it is.

39:58.180 --> 40:00.180
How can an immortal who's in love

40:00.610 --> 40:02.340
call himself an immortal?

40:03.770 --> 40:05.620
Does Supreme God need to

40:05.620 --> 40:07.060
talk through a demon?

40:08.740 --> 40:11.220
Don't you want to be yourself?

40:12.220 --> 40:15.140
Why are you still clinging to doctrine?

40:16.700 --> 40:18.740
Let me tell you what doctrine is.

40:19.700 --> 40:22.820
It's about beloved ones and

40:23.700 --> 40:24.980
peace for all beings in the Three Realms.

40:25.410 --> 40:27.580
Since you can't let go of Liu Shao,

40:27.580 --> 40:29.740
why do have to become immortal anyway?

40:31.180 --> 40:33.700
The people of Immortal Palace are all self-righteous.

40:33.780 --> 40:35.740
They talk about the immortals and the Three Realms.

40:35.740 --> 40:37.260
It sounds noble.

40:37.860 --> 40:39.340
But they're the same as me,

40:39.690 --> 40:41.300
unable to let go of desire and love.

40:41.860 --> 40:43.300
What a joke!

40:43.300 --> 40:44.740
Why do you care?

41:01.940 --> 41:02.780
Immortal.

41:24.540 --> 41:25.380
Xiyin Mountain.

41:30.220 --> 41:31.580
Xijin Mountain is stable.

41:32.620 --> 41:33.820
Did Luo Ge…

41:37.220 --> 41:38.100
That's right.

41:41.060 --> 41:42.180
He did it.
